WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.964 --> 00:00:19.169
When Vinnie Mandy finished the Iroquois trip, Dad had opened the attic door suddenly.

2
00:00:20.129 --> 00:00:22.610
Then he slipped and twisted his ankle.

3
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.530
"Oh, that hurts!"

4
00:00:26.131 --> 00:00:27.251
Dad said in pain.

5
00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:31.132
He was sitting in his favorite chair in the living room.

6
00:00:32.144 --> 00:00:34.967
Mom held a bag of ice on his swollen foot.

7
00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:41.232
"I was going to clean up the attic, but I can't now," Dad said.

8
00:00:41.252 --> 00:00:43.354
"Can you kids do it?"

9
00:00:44.915 --> 00:00:47.898
Vinnie and Mandy clapped their hands excitedly.

10
00:00:47.918 --> 00:00:52.822
"Sure, we'll take care of it," said Vinnie cheerfully.

11
00:00:52.842 --> 00:00:57.045
"What's so special about that attic?"

12
00:00:57.686 --> 00:01:00.108
Dad asked Mom as the kids ran off.

13
00:01:01.212 --> 00:01:03.474
The children raced up the attic stairs.

14
00:01:05.155 --> 00:01:06.997
Mandy grabbed the photo album.

15
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:12.681
"Let's guess where we're going next," she said.

16
00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:16.804
"Okay, I'm going to guess Africa!"

17
00:01:17.464 --> 00:01:18.185
said Vinnie.

18
00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:21.547
"I think it's going to be China!"

19
00:01:22.188 --> 00:01:24.830
said Mandy, opening the photo album.

20
00:01:26.431 --> 00:01:27.572
They were both wrong.

21
00:01:28.592 --> 00:01:33.256
In the photo, the old man was standing in front of a large tower.

22
00:01:34.356 --> 00:01:37.579
There were big black birds flying around his head.

23
00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:41.602
A group of men with spears were marching together.

24
00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.064
The spears were glowing.

25
00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:49.087
is this?"

26
00:01:49.888 --> 00:01:50.528
asked Vinnie.

27
00:01:50.548 --> 00:01:55.252
"It looks like began Mandy.

28
00:01:56.436 --> 00:01:58.938
The light forced them to close their eyes.

29
00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.180
The children fell down the dark tunnel.

30
00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:08.764
Mandy landed first.

31
00:02:09.245 --> 00:02:10.366
She opened her eyes.

32
00:02:11.466 --> 00:02:15.129
Two horses pulling a wagon were coming straight at her.

33
00:02:18.091 --> 00:02:20.712
Screaming, Mandy jumped out of the way.

34
00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:25.736
Then she tripped, fell, and scraped her knee badly.

35
00:02:27.544 --> 00:02:31.825
"Whoa!" The driver of the wagon stopped the horses.

36
00:02:31.845 --> 00:02:34.266
"Where did you come from, miss?

37
00:02:35.506 --> 00:02:37.507
I didn't see anyone walking in the street."

38
00:02:38.547 --> 00:02:40.188
The driver scratched his head.

39
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:46.390
"I I'm terribly sorry, sir," Mandy stammered.

40
00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.790
Her legs felt shaky.

41
00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.731
"Where am I?"

42
00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:51.991
she wondered.

43
00:02:52.011 --> 00:02:54.632
"And where is Vinnie?"

44
00:02:56.688 --> 00:02:58.710
Vinnie landed on the same street.

45
00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.372
A carriage came toward him.

46
00:03:02.192 --> 00:03:03.873
Vinnie quickly stepped aside.

47
00:03:04.894 --> 00:03:07.496
Looking around, he did not see Mandy.

48
00:03:08.336 --> 00:03:11.999
She was hidden by all the wagons and horses in the street.

49
00:03:12.019 --> 00:03:16.122
"To be or not to be!"

50
00:03:16.802 --> 00:03:17.623
cried a voice.

51
00:03:18.884 --> 00:03:21.346
Vinnie saw a boy behind some barrels.

52
00:03:22.306 --> 00:03:24.328
He was reading from a piece of paper.

53
00:03:25.532 --> 00:03:27.174
The boy did not see Vinnie.

54
00:03:27.194 --> 00:03:29.856
"That is the question!"

55
00:03:30.396 --> 00:03:31.477
continued the boy.

56
00:03:31.497 --> 00:03:36.341
"Ahem," said Vinnie, clearing his throat.

57
00:03:36.362 --> 00:03:40.085
"Hey, stop spying on me!"

58
00:03:40.785 --> 00:03:42.727
said the boy, hiding the paper.

59
00:03:42.747 --> 00:03:44.529
"Who are you?"

60
00:03:44.549 --> 00:03:47.211
"My name is Vinnie.

61
00:03:47.611 --> 00:03:50.073
Who are you, and what are you reading?"

62
00:03:50.093 --> 00:03:55.829
"My name is Edward," said the boy, bowing dramatically.

63
00:03:55.849 --> 00:03:59.691
"I am reading a play by Shakespeare!"

64
00:04:00.651 --> 00:04:02.853
The name sounded familiar to Vinnie.

65
00:04:02.873 --> 00:04:07.535
"Someday, I will be England's greatest actor!"

66
00:04:08.135 --> 00:04:08.955
shouted Edward.

67
00:04:08.975 --> 00:04:13.237
"Someday, I will perform before the queen!"
